## API

The backend will expose RESTful API endpoints required by the application.

Each endpoint should provide:

- Appropriate HTTP methods
- Request validation
- Consistent response formats
- Proper HTTP status codes
- Error handling
- Database interaction through Prisma
- Authentication and authorization checks where required

### Example

```http
GET    /api/tours
GET    /api/tours/:id
POST   /api/tours
PUT    /api/tours/:id
DELETE /api/tours/:id
```

The final endpoint structure will be based on the application's actual requirements.

