## User & Access Management

The backend will support user management according to the defined roles.

### Features

- User creation
- User login
- User management
- Password hashing
- Role assignment
- Role-based authorization
- Protected API routes
- Account/profile management where required
- Prevention of unauthorized access

Passwords must never be stored as plain text.

---

## Tour Management

Tour management will respect the role permissions.

| Action | Super Admin | Admin | Tour Guide |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| Create tours | Yes | Yes | Yes, subject to business rules |
| View tours | Yes | Yes | Yes |
| Update tours | Yes | Yes | Assigned tours only |
| Delete tours | Yes | Yes | Subject to business rules |
| Manage users | Yes | Yes | No |

> **Note:** Exact permissions can be adjusted based on the client's final business requirements.

