## Client Decisions Required

The following decisions should be confirmed before final implementation:

| Decision | Why It Matters |
|---|---|
| **Authentication method** | Determines how users authenticate and how protected API requests are handled. |
| **Role permissions** | Confirms exactly what Super Admins, Admins, and Tour Guides can do. |
| **Tour assignment rules** | Defines how tours are assigned to Tour Guides and what they can manage. |
| **Cart ownership** | Determines whether cart data is stored on the server or primarily in the browser. |
| **Payment handling** | Determines whether a payment gateway such as PayMongo or Stripe will be integrated. |
| **File storage** | Determines where tour images and payment proof files will be stored. |
| **Email provider** | Determines how the system will send emails, such as contact-message replies. |

